<%# What the run was told to do with each block, in the rows the Run modal asks for it in:
    whether the block ran, what fed it, and how many of its pages were asked for. The
    fieldset in job_details disables the controls; nothing here has to say so itself.

    A block that was not ticked is still listed: what a run was told to leave alone is as
    much a part of how it was configured as what it was told to do. Its unticked box says
    so, so its input and page fields have nothing left to add and are left empty.

    RunBlockSummary answers per block what RunBlockRow asks per block, and lists them in
    the same order.

    locals:
      pipeline_job: the run being described %>
<div>
  <span class='form-label'>Blocks to run</span>

  <div class='border rounded'>
    <div class='row gx-2 px-2 pt-2 small text-body-secondary'>
      <div class='col-4'>Block</div>
      <div class='col-5'>Input</div>
      <div class='col-3'>Pages</div>
    </div>

    <% RunBlockSummary.for(pipeline_job).each_with_index do |summary, index| %>
      <div class='row gx-2 align-items-center p-2 <%= 'border-top' if index.positive? %>'>
        <div class='col-4'>
          <div class='form-check mb-0'>
            <%= check_box_tag "job-block-#{summary.id}-run", '1', summary.ran?,
                              class: 'form-check-input', name: nil %>

            <%= label_tag "job-block-#{summary.id}-run", class: 'form-check-label' do %>
              <%= summary.label %>
              <span class='badge bg-light text-dark fw-normal'><%= summary.kind_label %></span>
            <% end %>
          </div>
        </div>

        <%# An enrichment iterates records back out of the destination and is never offered
            an input or a page limit, in the modal or here. %>
        <% if summary.enrichment? %>
          <div class='col-8'>
            <span class='text-body-secondary small'>Harvested records</span>
          </div>
        <% else %>
          <div class='col-5'>
            <%= job_block_input_field(summary) %>
          </div>

          <div class='col-3'>
            <%= number_field_tag nil, job_block_pages(summary),
                                 autocomplete: 'off',
                                 placeholder: job_block_pages_placeholder(summary),
                                 class: 'form-control form-control-sm',
                                 name: nil, id: nil %>
          </div>
        <% end %>
      </div>
    <% end %>
  </div>
</div>
